cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: Agent Collab Treaty
abstract: >-
  A drop-in documentation contract for repositories worked on by AI agents,
  humans, or both. Five Markdown files and an archive folder give every agent
  session a startup contract, a decision-centric work log, and a living
  roadmap; the treaty CLI installs them as a Copier template and updates them
  in place with a three-way merge.
